# Releasing the handle of a source whose only other strong reference is a filter-parent link:
# a filter on a source keeps its own reference (filter_add takes one).  Destroying the filter handle first does not
# destroy the filter.
kind in input video create,destroy
kind fl filter video create,destroy
create a in A
create f fl F
filter_add a f
refs f
release f
pending
filter_remove a f
